    "id": "shm-mcq-346",
    "questionNumber": 346,
    "question": "Two masses $m_1$ and $m_2$ are connected by a spring of force constant $k$ on a frictionless horizontal table. The system is pulled apart and released. The angular frequency of oscillation of the system is:",
